<title>USA: National Computer backs FY97 EPS consensus.</title>
<headline>National Computer backs FY97 EPS consensus.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Minn. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Computer Systems Inc on Thursday said it expected its fiscal 1997 earnings to be in line with analysts' estimates of $1.52 a share.</p>
<p>&quot;That is in the ballpark, that's about right, that's where we would have them,&quot; Russell Gullotti, chairman, president and chief executive officer, told Reuters after the company's annual shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;The analysts show ranges from $1.48 to $1.55,&quot; he said. &quot;The people at $1.55 are too high and those at $1.48 too low.&quot;</p>
</text>
